WEBVTT

00:07:28.110 --> 00:07:32.198
and that he could persevere
to achieve that goal.

00:07:33.407 --> 00:07:34.617
Amazing.

00:07:35.201 --> 00:07:38.787
But when I share that story
with other parents,

00:07:38.829 --> 00:07:41.499
many of them shake their head
and say, "You know what?

00:07:41.499 --> 00:07:43.209
My kid could never do that

00:07:43.250 --> 00:07:47.296
because my kids don't have
the entrepreneurial gene."

00:07:48.839 --> 00:07:53.219
Well, being entrepreneurial
is not genetic.

00:07:54.303 --> 00:07:57.223
It is a set of behaviors

00:07:57.264 --> 00:08:00.684
that can be learned
when given the opportunity.